Garfield's Pet Force is a 2009 American animated superhero comedy film based on characters from
the Jim Davis comic strip Garfield and loosely based on the Pet Force novel series.

12
00:40:10,434 --> 00:40:16,434
It is the third installment of the animated movie series,
following Garfield Gets Real and Garfield's Fun Fest.

13
00:43:31,304 --> 00:43:37,304
Also, it is the fifth Garfield movie overall.

14
00:46:52,173 --> 00:46:58,173
It was released on DVD and Blu-ray Disc in the United States on June 16, 2009, by 20th Century Fox Home
Entertainment, while it was pre-sold overseas by sales representative Velvet Octopus.

15
00:50:13,043 --> 00:50:19,043
It was written by Garfield creator Jim Davis.

16
00:53:33,913 --> 00:53:39,913
It was released theatrically in 3-D in select countries such as Poland, Italy, Mexico and
Spain, and became the most profitable film in the franchise until 2024.

17
00:56:54,782 --> 00:57:00,782
It is the last Garfield film to be distributed by 20th Century Fox (who lost the film and television rights to the
Garfield franchise shortly after the film's release), ten years prior to Nickelodeon's acquisition of Paws, Inc.

